src = src.replace("Under nonzero jitter 5 conditions met the rule (three for late-fusion RF at κ = 0.5, two for logistic fusion at κ = 1 and σ = 300 s); these are exploratory.", "Under nonzero jitter five model/fusion combinations in four cells met the rule (late-fusion RF at κ = 0.5 for σ = 60, 120, and 300 s; late and concatenation logistic fusion at κ = 1, σ = 300 s); these are exploratory.")
rep('''It remains below the best tabular model: cyber LR at κ = 0 (0.884) and late-fusion RF at κ = 1 (0.950).''', '''It remains below the best tabular model: cyber LR at κ = 0 (0.884) and physical-only RF at κ = 1 (0.969; late-fusion RF 0.950).''')
rep('''so alignment error of two and a half window half-widths degrades the best cyber model beyond doubt.''', '''so alignment error of two and a half window half-widths degrades the best cyber model on this data under the pre-specified rule.''')
rep('''**RQ1 / H1′.** The choice between event time and processing time is immaterial at a five-minute sampling cadence: the 1.4 s mean lag changes the label of two events in twelve thousand and costs nothing in ranking quality.''',
    '''**RQ1 / H1′.** For this dataset—five-minute sampling with a 1.4 s mean processing lag—the choice between event time and processing time changed the label of two events in twelve thousand and cost nothing in ranking quality; the result is bounded to that cadence, lag distribution, and ±120 s window.''')
rep('''The framework's timestamp requirement is therefore a bound on alignment error relative to the window, not a preference for one timestamp field."),''',
    '''For this configuration the framework's timestamp requirement is therefore a bound on alignment error relative to the window rather than a preference for one timestamp field; other cadences or lag distributions would need the same test."),''')
rep('''The method generalizes to any replay of one time series onto another.",''', '''The method is designed to transfer to other replays of one time series onto another; it has been demonstrated on one benchmark pairing.",''')
rep('''and no result in this praxis is evidence of an actual cyber-physical incident near PANC.''', '''no result in this praxis is evidence of an actual cyber-physical incident near PANC, and every quantitative statement is bounded to the evaluated dataset, window scale, and conditions.''')
